Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Comment:
 The debian/copyright file is generated from debian/copyright.header
 and debian/copyright.d files using `debian/rules debian/copyright`
 .
 The debian/copyright.d files are edited from files scanned with decopy,
 the originals are in debian/copyright.in.d using `debian/rules run-decopy`

